- Double tap returned to fit. A two-finger pinch with moving midpoint and
  one-finger continuation enlarged/panned without changing the selected photo.
- Inward pinch returned to fit. ACTION_CANCEL and a vertical drag did not
  navigate; the next ordinary left swipe changed 1 to 2.
- Repeated Next across initial metadata boundaries reached TEST_0049, 49 / 49;
  Next disabled, the displayed fixture number matched the filename.
- Before-download raw checkpoint contains no GetObject. All the above viewing
  used previews. Original transfers were requested only by the following two
